<title>AUSTRALIA: Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Oct 11.</title>
<headline>Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Oct 11.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Thursday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>				Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		   Yield     Close</p>
<p> 1 McIntosh Sec	    10.59    0.85</p>
<p> 2 Prime Credit Tr	 10.21    0.96</p>
<p> 3 Indu Property	   10.00    0.91</p>
<p> 4 Prop Income Inv	  9.96    1.02</p>
<p> 5 Villa World		9.82    1.12</p>
<p> 6 BT Prop Trust	    9.38    1.74</p>
<p> 7 Aust Tour		  9.04    0.83</p>
<p> 8 Central Equity	   9.00    1.00</p>
<p> 9 Colonial Mutual	  8.89    1.19</p>
<p>10 Centro Prop		8.86    2.20</p>
<p>11 Equitilink		 8.62    0.58</p>
<p>12 Armstrong Retail	 8.57    0.77</p>
<p>13 Gandel Retail Tr	 8.48    0.92</p>
<p>14 Gen Prop Tr		8.38    2.40</p>
<p>15 Westpac Prop Tr	  8.36    1.62</p>
<p>16 Natl In Prop	     8.28    1.01</p>
